        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Multi-node untuk Logika Kompleks",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Jangan gabung semua logika dalam satu node\n\u2022 Pisahkan jadi beberapa node spesifik\n\u2022 Contoh: CONSTANT (amount) \u2192 AND \u2192 ALERT",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;gap:3px;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">AMOUNT</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #6366f1;font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">AND</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #ef4444;font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;\">ALERT</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Auto-Arrange Rutin",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Klik **Auto-Arrange** kalau flow berantakan\n\u2022 Susun ulang node dari kiri ke kanan\n\u2022 Gunakan Connected Move agar node tetangga ikut bergerak",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fff);border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f59e0b;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">\u2728 Auto-Arrange</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Gunakan Groups",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Kelompokkan node terkait dengan **Group**\n\u2022 Beri nama deskriptif (\"Cek Amount\", \"Cek Velocity\")\n\u2022 Group bisa di-collapse, di-copy antar rule",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
